card.statement:
For any $z, w\in\mathbb{Z}^{\frac{n(n-1)}{2}}$ with $w\neq\tau(w)$, the action of the generators of $\Gamma$ on $V(T(\bar{v}))$ is given by:

\begin{align*}
c_{rs}(T(\bar{v}+z)&=\gamma_{rs}(\bar{v}+z)T(\bar{v}+z)\\
c_{rs}(\mathcal{D}T(\bar{v}+w)))&=\gamma_{rs}(\bar{v}+w)\mathcal{D}T(\bar{v}+w))+\mathcal{D}^{\overline{v}}(\gamma_{rs}(v+w))T(\bar{v}+w).
\end{align*}

Moreover, $\dim V(T(\bar{v}))(\sm)\leq 2$ for any $\sm\in\Sp\Ga$.
